          "urpx:description": "Residential customer enrolled in CARE. Sheet 1 APPLICABILITY qualifies the applicant \"for California Alternate Rates for Energy (CARE) under the eligibility and certification criteria set forth in Electric Rule 19.1\"; Special Condition 2 limits it to the primary residence and states that \"Customers or sub-metered tenants participating in the Family Electric Rate Assistance (FERA) program cannot concurrently participate in the CARE program.\"",
